  "notes": [
    "All proportions and angles are integers. Body section u=0 is head, u=1000 is tail. Dimensions are per mille of body length.",
    "Sections must be ordered from 0 to 1000. Fin outlines must be convex non-degenerate polygons anchored by a point at (0,0) or a base on y=0, with y>=0.",
    "Motion speed is millimeters/second, frequency is milli-Hz, amplitude is per mille of body length. Behavior depth 100 is near seabed, 900 is near surface.",
    "Create a distinct silhouette, validate, save, release the exact revision/hash, and open oceanUrl. No scripts or external assets."
  ]
